    674  2dd3							; tremolo LFO, every 10 ms: tremA = 0-15. The sound's own (NES pulses with
    675  2dd3							; an envelope), the menu's TREMOLO ON (the ADVANCED SOUND values) or TREMOLO
    676  2dd3							; held (SPACE / a button): those two also move the SID's volume and the NES
    677  2dd3							; pulses of sounds without an envelope (held on a sound with none: the
    678  2dd3							; ADVANCED SOUND values). TREMOLO OFF: none. The Game Boy has no tremolo yet.
    679  2dd3				   TremTick
    680  2dd3					      subroutine
    681  2dd3		       20 6b 30 	      jsr	RelClock	; (v0.34: the SID's release clocks)
    682  2dd6		       ae 95 c3 	      ldx	soundMode
